      "url": "https://www.1enrollment.com/information/product.cfm?page=39509&id=767303",
      "v": "Two designs: $6,000 or $8,000 deductible, coinsurance 0% paid by the member, coinsurance out-of-pocket $0. COVERAGE PERIOD MAXIMUM $5,000,000 - the highest in the portfolio. OFFICE VISITS ARE COPAY-BASED: $40 PCP, $60 Specialist, with a hard visit count - 'Up to 6 months: Single 1 total, Family 3 total. Over 6 months: Single 2 total, Family 4 total.' PHARMACY: '$10 Copay on generic drugs, MAXIMUM BENEFIT OF $3,000.' Adult screenings include immunizations.",
